Hello list,

I don't know if there are any perl programmers on the list, but I have
been working on a perl script to configure netfilter for a while now.  I
haven't spent that many hours on it as I keep getting distracted by more
urgent things, but I think I have it working pretty will now, and it
should support most configurations.

The attached files can be found at: http://mutant-powers.net/code/

I would like very much for anybody that knows perl to take a look and
let me know what you think.  If you don't know perl, take a look anyway
and see if it's friendly enough not to need to know perl.

Any feedback or ideas are welcome, thanks in advance,
	--Erik ( erike@pbgnw.com / erike@visi.com )

